### Insere um novo carro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/car
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"500",
    "brandId":1,
    "color":"YELLOW",
    "drivetrain":"FF",
    "weight":800,
    "power":100,
    "rpm":5700
}

### atualiza um novo carro
PUT  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/car/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"GT",
    "brandId":2,
    "color":"RED",
    "drivetrain":"FR",
    "weight":1200,
    "power":150,
    "rpm":6500
}

### busca um carro pelo id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/car/6

### busca todos os carros
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/car

#### deleta um carro pelo id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/car/6